\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces  \textbf  {Effect of extension length on search time} (0--20\,nt, 32 threads, matched gzip output). Numbers above bars give RIsearch's time relative to RIsearch2. RIsearch's advantage grows with extension length as the Gotoh dynamic-programming stage comes to dominate runtime; at extension~0 (seed matching only) the two tools are closer. }}{S5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:risearch-extension}{{S3}{S5}{\textbf {Effect of extension length on search time} (0--20\,nt, 32 threads, matched gzip output). Numbers above bars give RIsearch's time relative to RIsearch2. RIsearch's advantage grows with extension length as the Gotoh dynamic-programming stage comes to dominate runtime; at extension~0 (seed matching only) the two tools are closer}{figure.3}{}}
